{"number":104,"nameArabic":"الهمزة","nameTransliterated":"Al-Humazah","nameTranslated":"The Traducer","revelationPlace":"makkah","versesCount":9,"verses":[{"ayah":1,"verseKey":"104:1","textAr":"وَيۡلٞ لِّكُلِّ هُمَزَةٖ لُّمَزَةٍ","transliteration":"Waylun likulli humazatin lumazatin","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Woe to every scorner and mocker"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"تباہی ہے ہر اُس شخص کے لیے جو (منہ در منہ) لوگوں پر طعن اور (پیٹھ پیچھے) برائیاں کرنے کا خوگر ہے"}]},{"ayah":2,"verseKey":"104:2","textAr":"ٱلَّذِي جَمَعَ مَالٗا وَعَدَّدَهُۥ","transliteration":"Allathee jamaAAa malan waAAaddadahu","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Who collects wealth and [continuously] counts it"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"جس نے مال جمع کیا اور اُسے گن گن کر رکھا"}]},{"ayah":3,"verseKey":"104:3","textAr":"يَحۡسَبُ أَنَّ مَالَهُۥٓ أَخۡلَدَهُۥ","transliteration":"Yahsabu anna malahu akhladahu","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"He thinks that his wealth will make him immortal"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"وہ سمجھتا ہے کہ اُس کا مال ہمیشہ اُس کے پاس رہے گا"}]},{"ayah":4,"verseKey":"104:4","textAr":"كَلَّاۖ لَيُنۢبَذَنَّ فِي ٱلۡحُطَمَةِ","transliteration":"Kalla layunbathanna fee alhutamati","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"No! He will surely be thrown into the Crusher"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"ہرگز نہیں، وہ شخص تو چکنا چور کر دینے والی جگہ میں پھینک دیا جائے گا"}]},{"ayah":5,"verseKey":"104:5","textAr":"وَمَآ أَدۡرَىٰكَ مَا ٱلۡحُطَمَةُ","transliteration":"Wama adraka ma alhutamatu","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And what can make you know what is the Crusher"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور تم کیا جانو کہ کیا ہے وہ چکنا چور کر دینے والی جگہ؟"}]},{"ayah":6,"verseKey":"104:6","textAr":"نَارُ ٱللَّهِ ٱلۡمُوقَدَةُ","transliteration":"Naru Allahi almooqadatu","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"It is the fire of Allah, [eternally] fueled"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اللہ کی آگ، خوب بھڑکائی ہوئی"}]},{"ayah":7,"verseKey":"104:7","textAr":"ٱلَّتِي تَطَّلِعُ عَلَى ٱلۡأَفۡـِٔدَةِ","transliteration":"Allatee tattaliAAu AAala alafidati","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Which mounts directed at the hearts"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"جو دلوں تک پہنچے گی"}]},{"ayah":8,"verseKey":"104:8","textAr":"إِنَّهَا عَلَيۡهِم مُّؤۡصَدَةٞ","transliteration":"lnnaha AAalayhim musadatun","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Indeed, Hellfire will be closed down upon them"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"وہ اُن پر ڈھانک کر بند کر دی جائے گی"}]},{"ayah":9,"verseKey":"104:9","textAr":"فِي عَمَدٖ مُّمَدَّدَةِۭ","transliteration":"Fee AAamadin mumaddadatin","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"In extended columns"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"(اِس حالت میں کہ وہ) اونچے اونچے ستونوں میں (گھرے ہوئے ہوں گے)"}]}]}